WEBVTT

00:16.480 --> 00:17.650
<b>Are you nervous?</b>

00:17.950 --> 00:20.690
<b>No, it's just a track meet.</b>

00:20.990 --> 00:23.000
<b>Right, just a track meet.</b>

02:02.640 --> 02:06.810
<b>Episode 5:
"Hinode Bridge"</b>

02:24.170 --> 02:25.500
<i>He's smiling.</i>

02:47.280 --> 02:48.270
<b>Ready...</b>

03:00.440 --> 03:01.400
<b>Ready...</b>

03:22.980 --> 03:23.710
<b>Hey.</b>

03:24.520 --> 03:25.520
<b>Long time.</b>

03:25.520 --> 03:26.140
<b>How've you been?</b>

03:27.230 --> 03:29.170
<b>Not bad.</b>

03:31.090 --> 03:32.200
<b>How was it?</b>

03:32.680 --> 03:34.430
<b>Must be hard to get back into it.</b>

03:34.430 --> 03:35.610
<b>I'm here.</b>

03:38.110 --> 03:39.030
<b>Is that—</b>

03:39.030 --> 03:39.960
<b>I'm jealous.</b>

03:39.960 --> 03:42.840
<b>I'm Matsuda. I'm run sprints.</b>

03:42.840 --> 03:44.460
<b>I'm Nagai. I do hurdles.</b>

03:44.460 --> 03:45.570
<b>I'm Hyouno.</b>

03:45.970 --> 03:47.810
<b>I'm Yukinari's—</b>

03:47.810 --> 03:49.550
<b>Who cares, Yanagi. Let's go.</b>

03:50.500 --> 03:52.960
<b>They call each other by their first names.</b>

03:52.960 --> 03:56.530
<b>Yukinari, don't use up all your energy.</b>

03:58.450 --> 03:59.640
<b>You guys should</b>

04:00.530 --> 04:02.910
<b>get some release, too, 
or it'll hurt your performance.</b>

04:15.120 --> 04:17.950
<b>The fireworks were awesome the other day.</b>

04:17.950 --> 04:19.780
<b>I wish I saw it.</b>

04:19.780 --> 04:21.070
<b>Next year, for sure.</b>

04:21.510 --> 04:23.180
<b>They're really huge up close!</b>

04:23.180 --> 04:25.200
<b>Are you sure you should have said that?</b>

04:25.500 --> 04:26.990
<b>They're going to start rumors.</b>

04:26.990 --> 04:28.590
<b>Let them.</b>

04:49.560 --> 04:51.710
<b>I just remembered I have 
something to do. See you.</b>

05:22.580 --> 05:23.450
<b>Hey,</b>

05:24.970 --> 05:27.560
<b>is Hiro-kun on another...</b>

05:28.090 --> 05:30.030
<b>A date, I think.</b>

05:31.210 --> 05:34.300
<b>If you don't mind me asking, whom's he with?</b>

05:34.300 --> 05:36.320
<b>I wouldn't know.</b>

05:36.890 --> 05:38.020
<b>That's right.</b>

05:39.540 --> 05:41.850
<b>Of course you wouldn't.</b>

05:42.370 --> 05:44.230
<b>Touko-san, was it?</b>

05:45.310 --> 05:46.230
<b>Yes.</b>

05:46.230 --> 05:48.450
<b>You've become even</b>

05:48.450 --> 05:50.460
<b>more of a lady lately.</b>

05:50.460 --> 05:52.690
<b>Summer is the season of love, huh?</b>

05:53.700 --> 05:57.090
<b>Excuse me, I've said too 
much to a dear customer.</b>

05:57.090 --> 05:58.080
<b>No, it's fine.</b>

05:58.080 --> 06:02.080
<b>Let me bring you a cookie 
to make up for it, on me.</b>

06:02.520 --> 06:03.420
<b>Thanks.</b>

06:04.610 --> 06:05.530
<b>Thanks.</b>

06:12.760 --> 06:14.640
<b>Sacchan</b>

06:15.320 --> 06:16.720
<b>No way.</b>

06:17.270 --> 06:19.200
<b>But, then...</b>

06:19.750 --> 06:22.030
<b>Who? Who?!</b>

06:28.220 --> 06:29.610
<b>Thanks for earlier.</b>

06:29.990 --> 06:33.830
<b>You chased me down all 
out of breath just to say that?</b>

06:36.890 --> 06:39.040
<b>I wanted to talk to you about something.</b>

06:39.930 --> 06:41.600
<b>I bet you've done it before, too.</b>

06:41.600 --> 06:44.630
<b>Talking to the plaster figure in the art room</b>

06:44.630 --> 06:46.860
<b>to gather your thoughts.</b>

06:46.860 --> 06:47.860
<b>Not really.</b>

06:47.860 --> 06:49.180
<b>Touko says she has.</b>

06:49.930 --> 06:53.050
<b>So are you saying I don't have to respond?</b>

07:06.210 --> 07:09.280
<b>Hello. Is Sacchan in?</b>

07:09.580 --> 07:10.870
<b>Touko-chan's here.</b>

07:11.370 --> 07:12.660
<b>She was coming today?</b>

07:13.800 --> 07:14.560
<b>Yeah.</b>

07:15.930 --> 07:17.020
<b>Touko-chan.</b>

07:18.090 --> 07:18.750
<b>Is it okay?</b>

07:19.040 --> 07:20.860
<b>I'll be right there.</b>

07:34.620 --> 07:35.680
<b>Come in.</b>

07:36.290 --> 07:37.680
<b>Thank you.</b>

07:37.680 --> 07:38.490
<b>No problem.</b>

07:44.780 --> 07:45.560
<b>What's wrong?</b>

07:45.960 --> 07:48.180
<b>Nothing. Come in.</b>

07:48.180 --> 07:48.920
<b>Okay.</b>

07:54.970 --> 07:55.700
<b>Huh...</b>

07:56.000 --> 07:57.710
<b>I think it's Mom.</b>

07:58.010 --> 07:59.330
<b>I'll go say hi.</b>

07:59.330 --> 08:00.700
<b>There's no hurry.</b>

08:00.700 --> 08:01.460
<b>Hm?</b>

08:25.520 --> 08:28.750
<b>Yuki hurt his leg during 
the summer of first year.</b>

08:28.750 --> 08:30.070
<b>He's rehabilitating.</b>

08:30.850 --> 08:34.810
<b>There was a joint middle-school
and high-school track meet today,</b>

08:35.180 --> 08:36.820
<b>but it didn't go too well.</b>

08:37.930 --> 08:39.230
<b>Hiro-kun has</b>

08:40.630 --> 08:42.630
<b>a date today.</b>

08:46.130 --> 08:48.470
<b>I thought it'd be with you.</b>

08:49.180 --> 08:52.550
<b>But I was already supposed 
to come over today.</b>

08:54.500 --> 08:57.070
<b>Sacchan, are you going out with Hiro-kun?</b>

08:57.370 --> 08:58.820
<b>He was here until earlier.</b>

09:01.000 --> 09:03.290
<b>So many surprises today.</b>

09:03.290 --> 09:06.620
<b>I didn't think you'd be going out.</b>

09:06.620 --> 09:08.310
<b>I didn't know.</b>

09:08.710 --> 09:10.560
<b>Touko-chan, you've got it wrong.</b>

09:10.560 --> 09:12.400
<b>I never said I'm going out with him.</b>

09:12.810 --> 09:15.750
<b>We were just reading together.</b>

09:15.750 --> 09:17.890
<b>Oh, right. Of course.</b>

09:17.890 --> 09:19.540
<b>I guess it wouldn't be anything more.</b>

09:20.510 --> 09:24.150
<b>And you? Have you met with 
that guy since then?</b>

09:24.720 --> 09:27.330
<b>Yeah, about that.</b>

09:28.050 --> 09:30.780
<b>Okikura-kun seems stern,</b>

09:30.780 --> 09:32.630
<b>but I thought maybe he has a nice side.</b>

09:33.220 --> 09:34.090
<b>Ah.</b>

09:34.550 --> 09:35.880
<b>And he's cute.</b>

09:36.600 --> 09:39.360
<b>Oh. No, no, no. It's not like that.</b>

09:40.630 --> 09:42.240
<b>Nothing like that.</b>

09:48.910 --> 09:52.280
<b>I'm going to be in the 
hospital for a while soon.</b>

09:52.990 --> 09:56.990
<b>It's just for tests, so it's 
nothing to worry about.</b>

09:56.990 --> 09:58.280
<b>Oh really?</b>

09:58.930 --> 10:02.730
<b>There's somewhere I want to go 
with you when I'm discharged.</b>

10:02.730 --> 10:03.860
<b>Where?</b>

10:04.520 --> 10:05.750
<b>I can't tell you yet.</b>

10:09.180 --> 10:11.040
<b>I wish I could see the future.</b>

10:11.770 --> 10:14.150
<b>I think Yuki's really worried.</b>

10:14.830 --> 10:17.010
<b>Everyone wants to know the future, right?</b>

10:19.260 --> 10:21.000
<b>Are you seriously not going to say anything?</b>

10:23.020 --> 10:23.900
<b>Nah,</b>

10:24.350 --> 10:25.560
<b>I won't see it.</b>

11:08.990 --> 11:10.430
<i>Okikura residence.</i>

11:10.430 --> 11:13.650
<b>Okikura-kun? It's Fukami.</b>

11:14.210 --> 11:17.730
<b>Can we meet up for a bit?</b>

11:18.090 --> 11:21.170
<b>I know. What you said 
to me the other night...</b>

11:21.170 --> 11:22.740
<b>I thought about it.</b>

11:25.260 --> 11:27.930
<i>Kakeru is out right now.</i>

11:27.930 --> 11:30.460
<i>Excuse my late introduction. 
I'm Kakeru's dad.</i>

11:31.450 --> 11:34.460
<i>I'll let him know you 
called when he gets home.</i>

11:41.390 --> 11:44.080
<i>I'm sorry. Good-bye.</i>

11:57.810 --> 11:59.390
<b>I'm home.</b>

12:05.500 --> 12:06.530
<b>Welcome home.</b>

12:06.530 --> 12:08.490
<b>You would do that!</b>

12:07.440 --> 12:08.490
<b>What is this?</b>

12:09.260 --> 12:10.600
<b>Nothing, nothing!</b>

12:10.600 --> 12:13.070
<b>I just thought maybe I'd read for once.</b>

12:13.070 --> 12:14.650
<b>So you bought it?</b>

12:14.650 --> 12:15.590
<b>Y-Y-Yes!</b>

12:15.590 --> 12:17.130
<b>No, you didn't.</b>

12:17.130 --> 12:19.120
<b>There's no chance you'd read Camus.</b>

12:19.120 --> 12:21.690
<b>Camus. Camus! <i>The Myth of Sisyphus</i>!</b>

12:21.690 --> 12:22.840
<b>It makes no sense!</b>

12:24.810 --> 12:26.910
<b>It's that tragic glasses girl.</b>

12:33.610 --> 12:35.540
<b>Hello, Fukami here.</b>

12:35.540 --> 12:38.110
<i>Hey. Sorry, I was out earlier.</i>

12:38.110 --> 12:40.570
<b>It's fine. I—</b>

12:41.070 --> 12:44.870
<i>My dad said he's sorry for 
troubling a young girl.</i>

12:45.240 --> 12:46.400
<i>I'm sorry, too.</i>

12:46.400 --> 12:49.160
<b>It was my mistake.</b>

12:49.460 --> 12:51.000
<i>Do you want to come over now?</i>

12:51.860 --> 12:53.630
<i>If you have time,</i>

12:53.630 --> 12:56.330
<i>my dad says he wants to cook 
for you to make up for it.</i>

12:56.330 --> 12:57.670
<b>Cook?</b>

12:57.670 --> 13:00.540
<i>Dad's been living alone for a long time.</i>

13:00.540 --> 13:01.800
<i>He's good at cooking.</i>

13:01.800 --> 13:03.220
<b>But—</b>

13:03.670 --> 13:05.470
<b>Didn't you want to talk to me?</b>

13:05.990 --> 13:08.040
<i>Yeah, but...</i>

13:08.360 --> 13:11.220
<b>There's something I need to tell you, too.</b>

13:12.420 --> 13:13.880
<i>Do you know how to get here?</i>

13:15.480 --> 13:16.660
<b>I don't.</b>

13:18.480 --> 13:19.480
<b>Come in.</b>

13:19.870 --> 13:21.550
<b>I'm Touko Fukami.</b>

13:21.550 --> 13:22.710
<b>Thanks for having me.</b>

13:23.370 --> 13:24.970
<b>I'll make something.</b>

13:24.970 --> 13:27.590
<b>Think of it as a light snack.</b>

13:28.130 --> 13:28.740
<b>Okay.</b>

13:29.390 --> 13:33.250
<b>Kakeru, make Fukami-san 
at home in the meantime.</b>

13:33.660 --> 13:37.140
<b>She's half my guest today, after all.</b>

13:37.140 --> 13:39.930
<b>All right. I'll keep her company.</b>

13:41.540 --> 13:44.010
<b>I'll show you to my room.</b>

13:44.590 --> 13:45.820
<b>That's my room.</b>

13:59.810 --> 14:00.690
<b>Hey...</b>

14:01.350 --> 14:02.020
<b>Yeah?</b>

14:02.430 --> 14:05.310
<b>When it rained the other day,</b>

14:05.670 --> 14:07.280
<b>on the road to Kirinkan...</b>

14:12.290 --> 14:13.430
<b>You saw.</b>

14:14.060 --> 14:16.400
<b>I wasn't hugging her.</b>

14:16.400 --> 14:17.610
<b>I just caught her.</b>

14:17.610 --> 14:18.900
<b>"Hugging"...</b>

14:18.900 --> 14:20.570
<b>She'd hurt her leg.</b>

14:20.570 --> 14:21.620
<b>You know about that, don't you?</b>

14:22.020 --> 14:24.100
<b>It's okay. I'm done talking.</b>

14:24.100 --> 14:26.580
<b>She nearly fell over on the steep road.</b>

14:33.260 --> 14:35.100
<b>Anyway, it's nothing.</b>

14:35.610 --> 14:39.440
<b>But the reason I wanted you over today 
is to talk about her—Takayama.</b>

14:40.370 --> 14:43.570
<b>Takayama is going to 
confess to Yukinari Imi.</b>

14:44.430 --> 14:45.150
<b>Eh?</b>

14:45.750 --> 14:49.240
<b>I said, Takayama is going 
to confess to Yukinari Imi.</b>

14:49.240 --> 14:50.810
<b>What? What? What?</b>

14:50.810 --> 14:52.900
<b>How do you know that about her?</b>

14:52.900 --> 14:54.170
<b>Did you see the future?</b>

14:54.170 --> 14:55.160
<b>She told me herself.</b>

14:56.510 --> 14:58.650
<b>She told me to tell you.</b>

15:03.360 --> 15:05.970
I want you to tell Touko about this.

15:08.020 --> 15:08.890
Because—

15:08.890 --> 15:10.180
I won't ask why.

15:11.020 --> 15:12.890
Don't talk, statue.

15:15.020 --> 15:16.050
Crap.

15:40.140 --> 15:41.330
<b>It's good.</b>

15:43.140 --> 15:44.330
<b>Say, Kakeru,</b>

15:44.330 --> 15:47.420
<b>this is a good opportunity. 
Why don't you get a cell phone?</b>

15:47.420 --> 15:48.930
<b>It'd be useful.</b>

15:48.930 --> 15:50.880
<b>Are they really that useful?</b>

15:51.490 --> 15:54.430
<b>Yeah. Well, I might die without one.</b>

15:55.980 --> 15:58.810
<b>Would anyone ever call me?</b>

16:01.940 --> 16:04.400
<b>Is Yana-chan's leg all better now?</b>

16:04.400 --> 16:05.390
<b>I think so.</b>

16:05.690 --> 16:07.800
<b>That's good to hear.</b>

16:07.800 --> 16:10.450
<b>Seriously, I know your boyfriend's there,</b>

16:10.450 --> 16:13.100
<b>but you've seriously got 
ears all over the hospital.</b>

16:13.100 --> 16:14.490
<b>How often are you there?</b>

16:14.490 --> 16:15.710
<b>Three days a week.</b>

16:16.550 --> 16:19.710
<b>They were such a cute couple.</b>

16:19.710 --> 16:22.820
<b>They're both remarried and have kids.</b>

16:22.820 --> 16:26.510
<b>There they are amidst 
their complicated family,</b>

16:26.510 --> 16:28.950
<b>like leaves in a cold blast, like a boat,</b>

16:28.950 --> 16:31.300
<b>their hearts tossed in a storm!</b>

16:31.300 --> 16:32.910
<b>Go away.</b>

16:33.950 --> 16:37.160
<b>Friendship punch!</b>

16:39.820 --> 16:42.150
<b>I had such a treat today.</b>

16:42.670 --> 16:43.690
<b>Thanks for having me over.</b>

16:44.250 --> 16:45.160
<b>See you.</b>

16:46.150 --> 16:48.320
<b>I found an interesting place the other day.</b>

16:49.700 --> 16:51.080
<b>It's nearby.</b>

16:51.550 --> 16:54.580
<b>When I found it, I knew 
I had to take you there.</b>

16:54.580 --> 16:56.220
<b>I've been meaning to ask you.</b>

16:56.700 --> 16:58.000
<b>Do you want to go now?</b>

16:58.640 --> 16:59.580
<b>Sure.</b>

17:00.030 --> 17:02.070
<b>Wait here. I'll get ready.</b>

19:08.820 --> 19:11.230
<b>Thanks for everything today.  
The meal was delicious.</b>

19:11.230 --> 19:14.600
<b>Say hi to your dad for me. 
I'll be heading home now.</b>

19:14.600 --> 19:15.730
<b>Bye.</b>

19:18.160 --> 19:20.880
<b>She still hasn't told me what 
she wanted to talk to me about.</b>

19:40.090 --> 19:42.370
<b>Yanagi. You haven't made it home yet?</b>

19:45.030 --> 19:46.200
<b>I'm resting here.</b>

19:47.160 --> 19:50.630
<b>This is where I take a break, 
eat, drink some water,</b>

19:50.630 --> 19:52.280
<b>and get ready for the rest of the trip.</b>

19:54.350 --> 19:55.590
<b>You don't have any water.</b>

19:56.640 --> 19:58.520
<b>There was something I wanted to tell you.</b>

20:07.340 --> 20:08.210
<b>I...</b>

20:09.140 --> 20:10.210
<b>like you.</b>

20:12.030 --> 20:14.130
<b>I know you like Touko.</b>

20:14.810 --> 20:16.550
<b>I know you confessed to her, too.</b>

20:17.450 --> 20:19.660
<b>I know it's going to be painful for me</b>

20:19.660 --> 20:22.770
<b>to live with you after you reject me.</b>

20:23.200 --> 20:25.880
<b>We're family, as you said.</b>

20:27.030 --> 20:28.720
<b>I know what your answer is.</b>

20:29.240 --> 20:32.970
<b>I mean, I would have been really 
happy if you gave up Touko for me,</b>

20:32.970 --> 20:34.410
<b>but I would have lost respect for you.</b>

20:35.160 --> 20:36.720
<b>Still, I wanted to tell you.</b>

20:37.400 --> 20:40.320
<b>I don't know what's going 
to happen to us now,</b>

20:40.620 --> 20:43.720
<b>but this is where I move forward.</b>

20:48.030 --> 20:49.870
<b>I wanted to tell you that here.</b>

20:53.020 --> 20:54.310
<b>I'll head home first.</b>

20:54.310 --> 20:57.020
<b>If I see you there, I hope we can 
keep things the way they were.</b>

21:10.250 --> 21:13.580
<b>I overheard something some high school girls</b>

21:13.580 --> 21:15.150
<b>said at the station.</b>

21:15.150 --> 21:19.220
<b>One of them said, "1221, year of the Joukyu war."</b>

21:20.200 --> 21:21.760
<b>High school girls are busy, too.</b>

21:22.290 --> 21:24.700
<b>Hina, can you set up the 
chopsticks and stuff?</b>

21:24.700 --> 21:26.430
<b>Okay.</b>

21:43.600 --> 21:45.770
<b>Onee-chan, come help.</b>

21:48.490 --> 21:50.490
<b>Onee-chan, dinner!</b>

21:50.490 --> 21:51.690
<b>Okay.</b>

23:28.840 --> 23:30.250
<b>I wanted to tell you myself.</b>

23:30.250 --> 23:32.320
<b>That doesn't explain anything.</b>

23:32.320 --> 23:34.470
<b>I'm a total idiot.</b>

23:34.470 --> 23:35.740
<b>What am I?!</b>

23:35.740 --> 23:37.930
<b>Come to the school yard. 
Let's put an end to this.</b>

23:36.180 --> 23:38.390
<b>Episode 6
"Punch"</b>

23:38.390 --> 23:40.390
<b></b>
